      "titleEn": "Introducing Gemini Omni",
      "summaryZh": "谷歌DeepMind发布了Gemini Omni，一个多模态AI模型，能够处理文本、图像、音频和视频，并具备实时交互能力。",
      "summaryEn": "Google DeepMind announced Gemini Omni, a multimodal AI model capable of processing text, images, audio, and video with real-time interaction capabilities.",
